description:
The appointed consultant will prepare a comprehensive Activity & Interpretation Plan which demonstrates how people will engage with St Peter's Church and the wider heritage of Thetford through:

•	Learning;
•	Volunteering;
•	Skills development;
•	Community engagement;
•	Interpretation;
•	Participation;
•	Events;
•	Training;
•	Outreach activities.

